msgstr "(no puedes guardar en modo INFINITO)"

msgctxt "woh_home:72"
msgid "You could leave something to charge here."
msgstr "Podrías dejar aquí algo para cargar."

msgctxt "woh_home:73"
msgid "CUSTOM MYSTERIES"
msgstr "MISTERIOS PERSONALIZADOS"

msgctxt "woh_home:74"
msgid "saving/loading is temporarily disabled"
msgstr "guardar/cargar está temporalmente inhabilitado"

msgctxt "woh_home:75"
msgid "No custom mysteries found."
msgstr "No se encontraron misterios personalizados."

msgctxt "woh_home:76"
msgid "by"
msgstr "por"

msgctxt "woh_home:77"
msgid "Length:"
msgstr "Largo:"

msgctxt "woh_home:78"
msgid "replaces mystery"
msgstr "reemplaza misterio"

msgctxt "woh_home:79"
msgid "(outfit locked)"
msgstr "(traje bloqueado)"

msgctxt "woh_home:80"
msgid "GO BACK"
msgstr "VOLVER"

msgctxt "woh_home:81"
msgid "That's a nice movie poster."
msgstr "Es un bonito póster de película."

msgctxt "woh_home:82"
msgid "CLASSIC MODE - OLD GODS are awakening! Your only chance of survival is solving five different mysteries. The end of the world is at hand!"
msgstr "MODO CLÁSICO: ¡LOS DIOSES ANTIGUOS despiertan! Tu única posibilidad para sobrevivir es resolver cinco misterios diferentes. ¡El fin del mundo está a un solo paso!"

msgctxt "woh_home:83"
msgid "ENDLESS MODE - It's hopeless! You can't stop the OLD GODS. In this mode, there are no mysteries to solve - earn points by surviving an endless stream of encounters."
msgstr "MODO INFINITO: ¡No hay esperanza! No puedes detener a los DIOSES ANTIGUOS En este modo, no hay misterios que resolver. Para ganar puntos resuelve una sarta interminable de encuentros."

msgctxt "woh_home:84"
msgid ""
"SCENARIO MODE - Short adventures set during the events of classic mode.\n"
"[coming in the future!]"
msgstr ""
"MODO ESCENARIO: Aventuras cortas que se desarrollan durante los eventos del modo clásico.\n"
"[¡pronto!]"

msgctxt "woh_home:85"
msgid "ENDLESS MODE"
msgstr "MODO INFINITO"

msgctxt "woh_home:86"
msgid ""
"The game begins with a ritual. You can choose which OLD GOD will be summoned.\n"
"\n"
"This selection will influence encounters and add unique events to your playthrough."
msgstr ""
"El juego empieza con un ritual. Puedes elegir qué DIOS ANTIGUO invocar.\n"
"\n"
"Esta elección influirá en los encuentros y agregará eventos únicos en tu partida."

msgctxt "woh_home:87"
msgid "select the OLD GOD to view them, and select them again to confirm your choice"
msgstr "selecciona el DIOS ANTIGUO para verlo, vuelve a seleccionarlo para confirmar tu elección"

msgctxt "woh_home:88"
msgid "somewhere, a group of people gathers, trying to awaken their master..."
msgstr "en alguna parte, un grupo se reúne e intenta despertar a su maestro…"

msgctxt "woh_home:89"
msgid "(additional modes will unlock as you progress)"
msgstr "(se desbloquearán modos extra a medida que avances)"

msgctxt "woh_home:90"
msgid "OLD GOD'S RULE"
msgstr "REGLA DEL DIOS ANTIGUO"

msgctxt "woh_home:91"
msgid "(character-exclusive perk cards only)"
msgstr "(solo tarjetas de pericia exclusivas de personaje)"

msgctxt "woh_home:92"
msgid "(all unlocked perk cards)"
msgstr "(todas las tarjetas de pericia desbloqueadas)"

msgctxt "woh_home:93"
msgid "(randomized item statistics)"
msgstr "(atributos aleatorios de objetos)"

msgctxt "woh_home:94"
msgid "BACKSTORY"
msgstr "TRASFONDO"

msgctxt "woh_home:95"
msgid "---CTHAC-ATORASU, THE SPIDER GOD---"
msgstr "---CTHAC-ATORASU, EL DIOS ARAÑA---"

msgctxt "woh_home:96"
msgid ""
"The terrible spider god, CTHAC-ATORASU is once again awakening from its slumber...\n"
"Blinded by its impossible-to-satisfy hunger, it has started to tear down the walls of its cocoon prison."
msgstr ""
"El espantoso dios araña, CTHAC-ATORASU una vez más despierta de su sueño…\n"
"Cegado por su hambre imposible de saciar, comenzó a rasgar los muros de su prisión-capullo."

msgctxt "woh_home:97"
msgid "ETERNAL WEB: You can't run from combat"
msgstr "TELA ETERNA No puedes huir de este enfrentamiento"

msgctxt "woh_home:98"
msgid "THE ETERNAL WEB"
msgstr "LA TELA ETERNA"

msgctxt "woh_home:99"
msgid ""
"CTHAC-ATORASU is once again awakening from its slumber...\n"
"\n"
"Blinded by its impossible-to-satisfy hunger, it has started to tear down the walls of its cocoon prison.\n"
"\n"
"Stop it before it devours us all."
msgstr ""
"CTHAC-ATORASU una vez más despierta de su sueño…\n"
"\n"
"Cegado por su hambre imposible de saciar, comenzó a rasgar los muros de su prisión-capullo.\n"
"\n"
"Detenlo antes de que nos devore a todos."

msgctxt "woh_home:100"
msgid "[you can't escape from combat encounters]"
msgstr "[no puedes huir de los encuentros]"

msgctxt "woh_home:101"
msgid "CTHAC-ATORASU"
msgstr "CTHAC-ATORASU"

msgctxt "woh_home:102"
msgid "---YGOTHAEG, THE IRRESISTIBLE GAZE---"
msgstr "---YGOTHAEG, LA MIRADA IRRESISTIBLE---"

msgctxt "woh_home:103"
msgid ""
"The nuclear tests in the Pacific region have awakened something evil in the depths of Mariana Trench.\n"
"YGOTHAEG is now slowly emerging, ready to once again rule the coastlines."
msgstr ""
"Las pruebas nucleares en la zona del Pacífico despertaron algo siniestro en las profundidades de la fosa de las Marianas.\n"
"YGOTHAEG se alza lentamente, listo para volver a reinar sobre las costas marinas."

msgctxt "woh_home:104"
msgid "GAZE OF YGOTHAEG: follow the commands or suffer its wrath"
msgstr "LA MIRADA DE YGOTHAEG: sigue las órdenes o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:105"
msgid "Don't investigate DOWNTOWN, FOREST and MANSION or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en el CENTRO DE LA CIUDAD, BOSQUE o MANSIÓN, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:106"
msgid "Don't investigate APARTMENTS, SCHOOL and VILLAGE or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en los DEPARTAMENTOS, ESCUELA o ALDEA, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:107"
msgid "Don't investigate HOSPITAL, FOREST and VILLAGE or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en el HOSPITAL, BOSQUE o ALDEA, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:108"
msgid "Don't investigate DOWNTOWN, MANSION and HOSPITAL or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en el CENTRO DE LA CIUDAD, MANSIÓN u HOSPITAL, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:109"
msgid "Don't investigate SCHOOL, SEASIDE and APARTMENTS or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en la ESCUELA, COSTA O DEPARTAMENTOS, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:110"
msgid "Don't investigate FOREST and SCHOOL or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en el BOSQUE ni en la ESCUELA, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:111"
msgid "Don't investigate HOSPITAL and MANSION or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No investigar en el HOSPITAL ni en la MANSIÓN, o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:112"
msgid "Don't blink or suffer its wrath."
msgstr "No parpadees o sufre su ira."

msgctxt "woh_home:113"
msgid "You won't cheat YGOTHAEG that easily... (+1% DOOM)"
msgstr "No engañarás tan fácil a YGOTHAEG… (+1 % de RUINA)"

msgctxt "woh_home:114"
msgid "YGOTHAEG is getting furious... (+2% DOOM)"
msgstr "YGOTHAEG se está enfureciendo… (+2 % de RUINA)"

msgctxt "woh_home:115"
msgid "IRRESISTIBLE GAZE"
msgstr "MIRADA IRRESISTIBLE"

msgctxt "woh_home:116"
msgid "The nuclear tests in the Pacific region have awakened something evil in the depths of the Mariana Trench. YGOTHAEG is now slowly emerging, ready to once again rule the coastlines."
msgstr "Las pruebas nucleares en la zona del Pacífico despertaron algo siniestro en las profundidades de la fosa de las Marianas. YGOTHAEG se alza lentamente, listo para volver a reinar sobre las costas marinas."

msgctxt "woh_home:117"
