msgctxt "woh_small:517"
msgid ""
"I write this for everyone wanting to stay behind.\n"
"\n"
"The sacrifice is worth it.\n"
"Life's meaning comes from our relationships.\n"
"Share death, and that connection will outlast you.\n"
"\n"
"There won't be anything left but US."
msgstr ""
"Escribo esto para todo aquel que quiera quedarse atrás.\n"
"\n"
"El sacrificio vale la pena.\n"
"El sentido de la vida son nuestras relaciones.\n"
"Comparte la muerte, esa conexión durará más que tú.\n"
"\n"
"No quedará nada más que NOSOTROS."

